{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.1793616545465",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "清晨的练习室",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 2,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kiriko.second",
  "supersedes": "draft.dialogue.kiriko.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kiriko.second",
    "idolId": "kiriko",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此……霧子真温柔啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "不、不是的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "而且……在灰尘多的地方练习……大家要是得了支气管哮喘就糟了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，那是不是有点想太多了？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "是、是这样……吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "我、我没什么自信……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "一想到可能会拖大家后腿，就想着至少……至少用这种方式帮上一点忙……！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。我明白了。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……嗯？她按着绷带那里……是疼吗。）",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "总之，你的心情我大概明白了。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，会想到去打扫，我觉得很了不起啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "难道你平时也偷偷打扫？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "不、不……那个……我也做不了什么大不了的事……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此……那你一定在很多地方都帮了忙。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "不、不是的……！不过，很少被人这样说……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "非常……很、很高兴……！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，是吗。那我也很高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（该怎么说呢——）",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "我觉得，这正是霧子的魅力。",
            "nextNodeId": "31"
          },
          {
            "label": "那……也让我一起打扫吧。",
            "nextNodeId": "35"
          },
          {
            "label": "这对霧子自己也有好处。",
            "nextNodeId": "38"
          }
        ]
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……诶？那、那种事……！",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "我从来没想过……魅力……吗。我、我身上也会有……吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "会有的。不过，得由霧子自己发现才行。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……由我……自己……",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "那、那样……太不好意思了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你在说什么。偶像和制作人是两人三脚。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……制作人先生……嗯……！我会努力的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "是、是的……我也……能舒服地练习了。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。不过这里也是霧子的练习室啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……偶像，幽谷霧子……我也是，偶像呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她小声重复了一遍，然后把抹布重新叠好。）"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（嗯？练习室里好像有人。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……きゅっきゅ♪",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……ごし、ごし♪",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "早上好，霧子。怎么这么早？今天应该没有早课。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "其他人好像也还没到——",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……啊，制作人先生。早、早上好……！",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "我、我稍微早到了一点……！",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以……你在打扫？",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "是、是的……我想，大家能舒舒服服地练习就好了……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
